{
	"_doc": "Quest journal (BG3 structure). category > quest > subquest(parent) > objective > step. A step is what just happened; an objective is what to do next. Current objective = highest-priority objective among unlocked steps. Step fields: objective, quest_op (''|add|add_only|close), result (completed|failed, for close), when (conditions, all must hold; see scripts/core/cond.gd), block (any holds = blocked), after (steps that must already be unlocked), xp, gold, approval {who: delta}. Steps without 'when' are unlocked by script ($ quest <quest> <step>). Every unlocked step sets flag q_<quest>_<step>. Objective fields: priority, completion (hidden, highest), markers [{level, node} or {level, pos}]. start_completed: quest is in the journal as completed from the start (you never did it). Text lives in data/text/journal.tsv: quest_<id>, obj_<quest>_<objective>, step_<quest>_<step>.",
	"categories": {
		"main": {"sort": 0},
		"companion": {"sort": 1},
		"side": {"sort": 2},
		"other": {"sort": 3}
	},
	"quests": {
